; One step of a frame's level. Per frame five cards in: snd and V and A (INP at gs, gv, ga), and a mode and a
; factor y (INP at gm, gy); three out (snd, V, A). Mode 0 leaves A, 1 makes it A y / 1000, 2 makes it A - A y /
; 1000, 3 makes it 0, 4 makes it A y / 100, at most 999. A y / 1000 is Horner over y's three digits c, b, a: c A,
; SFT 01, + b A, SFT 01, + a A, SFT 01, each digit times A a jump into the row of nine ADD xr (90-98), which runs
; into 99 and back; for A y / 100 the last shift (fin) is set to SFT 00.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            frm     INP   snd      03-31: a frame, and its mode
  04            gv      INP   v
  05            ga      INP   xr
  06            gm      INP   mode
  07            gy      INP   yy
  08                    CLA   mode
  09                    SUB   00
  10                    TAC   same
  11                    SUB   00
  12                    TAC   mul
  13                    SUB   00
  14                    TAC   less
  15                    SUB   00
  16                    TAC   none
  17                    CLA   s00      mode 4: A y / 100, at most 999
  18                    STO   fin
  19                    JMP   mul3
  20                    SUB   c999
  21                    TAC   fits
  22                    CLA   c999
  23                    JMP   st
  24            fits    ADD   c999
  25            st      STO   xr
  26                    CLA   s01
  27                    STO   fin
  28                    JMP   same
  29            none    CLA   z
  30                    STO   xr
  31                    JMP   same
  32            mul     JMP   mul3     32-39: A y / 1000, or A less it
  33                    STO   xr
  34                    JMP   same
  35            less    JMP   mul3
  36                    STO   d
  37                    CLA   xr
  38                    SUB   d
  39                    STO   xr
  40            same    OUT   snd      40-43: the frame out
  41                    OUT   v
  42                    OUT   xr
  43                    JMP   frm
  44            mul3    CLA   99       44-71: xr yy / 1000
  45                    STO   ret
  46                    CLA   yy
  47                    SFT   33
  48                    STO   d
  49                    CLA   cj
  50                    SUB   d
  51                    STO   j1
  52                    CLA   yy
  53                    SFT   23
  54                    STO   d
  55                    CLA   cj
  56                    SUB   d
  57                    STO   j2
  58                    CLA   yy
  59                    SFT   02
  60                    STO   d
  61                    CLA   cj
  62                    SUB   d
  63                    STO   j3
  64                    CLA   z
  65            j1      DATA  0        (JMP 99-c)
  66                    SFT   01
  67            j2      DATA  0        (JMP 99-b)
  68                    SFT   01
  69            j3      DATA  0        (JMP 99-a)
  70            fin     SFT   01
  71            ret     DATA  0
  72            snd     DATA  0
  73            v       DATA  0
  74            xr      DATA  0
  75            mode    DATA  0
  76            yy      DATA  0
  77            d       DATA  0
  78            z       DATA  0
  79            cj      JMP   99
  80            c999    DATA  999
  81            s00     SFT   00
  82            s01     SFT   01
  90            row     ADD   xr       90-98: the row of nine ADD xr, into 99
  91                    ADD   xr
  92                    ADD   xr
  93                    ADD   xr
  94                    ADD   xr
  95                    ADD   xr
  96                    ADD   xr
  97                    ADD   xr
  98                    ADD   xr
